# 6. Display the complete details of the employee(s) who earn the highest salary in each department.

```sql
SELECT e.*
FROM Employee AS e
INNER JOIN (
    SELECT Department,
           MAX(Salary) AS highest_salary
    FROM Employee
    GROUP BY Department
) AS d
ON e.Department = d.Department
AND e.Salary = d.highest_salary;
```

