# 7. Display the complete details of all employees whose salary is greater than the average salary of their own department.

```sql
SELECT e.*
FROM Employee AS e
INNER JOIN (
    SELECT Department,
           AVG(Salary) AS average_salary
    FROM Employee
    GROUP BY Department
) AS d
ON e.Department = d.Department
AND e.Salary > d.average_salary;
```

