# 12. Display the complete details of employees who earn the highest salary in the company.

```sql
SELECT e.*
FROM Employee AS e
INNER JOIN (
    SELECT MAX(Salary) AS max_salary
    FROM Employee
) AS d
ON e.Salary = d.max_salary;
```

