# 13. Display the complete details of employees who earn the second highest salary in the company.

```sql
SELECT e.*
FROM Employee AS e
INNER JOIN (
    SELECT DISTINCT Salary
    FROM Employee
    ORDER BY Salary DESC
    LIMIT 1 OFFSET 1
) AS d
ON e.Salary = d.Salary;
```
